      "description": "Phase 1: Uses Taunt every 4 turns. Other turns: 15% Defensive Stance, 15% Gloat (replaced with Defensive Stance on A19+), 25% Face Slap, 45% Heavy Slash. Cannot use same move twice in a row. When HP drops below 50%, uses Anger next turn to enter Phase 2. Phase 2: Uses Execute, then 2 random moves, then Execute again. Defensive Stance can only be used twice per battle.",
